---
import CenteredLayout from '../layouts/CenteredLayout.astro';
import Link from '../components/Link.astro';
---

<CenteredLayout>
  <header is-="column" gap-="1" space-="px:1">
    <h1 tabindex="0" autofocus>
      Hiya!
    </h1>
    <p tabindex="0">
      Hey, my name is Evelyn. I'm a software engineer from Germany, mainly focusing on Minecraft mods and plugins.
      <br />
      I'm also a backend developer and work with languages like Go, Rust, Kotlin and Java.
      <br />
      I have also been daily-driving Arch Linux for over five years now! I use niri btw.
      <br />
      My favourite programming languages are Rust and Kotlin.
      <br />

      You can find my works on
      <Link href="https://git.evelynmeow.com">tangled.org</Link>
      as well as on
      <Link href="https://github.com/evelynmeowww">Github</Link>
      <br />
      <br />

      Besides being a software engineer, I also do DJ'ing in front of friends for fun!
      <br />
      I love listening to music, namely genres like Drum and Bass, Dubstep, Hyperpop and further EDM.
      <br />
      My favourite video games include Minecraft, Celeste, THE FINALS and Sledding Game.
      <br />

      I'm also a moderator at
      <Link href="https://mcbrawls.net">MC Brawls</Link>
      and contribute to some of our libraries every so often!
      <br />
      <br />
      I'm currently also open to do commissions!
      <br />
      Send me an email to hello [at] this domain!
    </p>
  </header>
</CenteredLayout>
